<title>USA: Advanced Financial says may be delisted.</title>
<headline>Advanced Financial says may be delisted.</headline>
<dateline>SHAWNEE, Kan. 1996-12-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Advanced Financial Inc said it was told by the American Stock Exchange that the company has fallen below certain guidelines for continued listing and trading in its stock has been halted.</p>
<p>&quot;There can be no assurance that the listing will be continued or that trading will resume,&quot; the company said.</p>
<p>Advanced Financial is a mortgage banking company.</p>
<p>((--Chicago Newsdesk 312-408-8787))</p>
